{"id":12999,"date":"2026-01-21T10:05:37","date_gmt":"2026-01-21T10:05:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=12999"},"modified":"2026-01-21T10:07:04","modified_gmt":"2026-01-21T10:07:04","slug":"vyssi-citlivost-analytiky-v-upstream-bioprocesu-diky-time-gated-raman-spektroskopii","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/vyssi-citlivost-analytiky-v-upstream-bioprocesu-diky-time-gated-raman-spektroskopii\/","title":{"rendered":"Vy\u0161\u0161\u00ed citlivost anal\u00fdzy v upstream bioprocesu d\u00edky Time-Gated Raman spektroskopii"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"212\" data-end=\"551\">Nov\u00e1 studie publikovan\u00e1 v odborn\u00e9m \u010dasopise <em data-start=\"280\" data-end=\"319\">Bioprocess and Biosystems Engineering<\/em> ukazuje, \u017ee <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/picoraman-m3\/\"><strong data-start=\"332\" data-end=\"372\">Time-Gated Ramanova Spektroskopie (TGRS)<\/strong><\/a> v\u00fdrazn\u011b zvy\u0161uje citlivost p\u0159i monitorov\u00e1n\u00ed komplexn\u00edch upstream bioproces\u016f. Tento pokrok m\u00e1 z\u00e1sadn\u00ed v\u00fdznam pro <strong data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"524\">real-time \u0159\u00edzen\u00ed proces\u016f<\/strong> v biofarmaceutick\u00e9 v\u00fdrob\u011b.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"1022\">Bioprocesy, zejm\u00e9na kultivace sav\u010d\u00edch bun\u011bk, jako jsou nap\u0159. <strong data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"672\">CHO (Chinese Hamster Ovary)<\/strong>, vy\u017eaduj\u00ed p\u0159esn\u00e9 a kontinu\u00e1ln\u00ed sledov\u00e1n\u00ed kl\u00ed\u010dov\u00fdch analyt\u016f \u2013 gluk\u00f3zy, lakt\u00e1tu, amoniaku, glutaminu, alaninu a dal\u0161\u00edch.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"1022\">Standardn\u00ed inline n\u00e1stroje procesn\u00ed anal\u00fdzy, v\u010detn\u011b klasick\u00e9 Ramanovy spektroskopie, jsou sice \u0161iroce vyu\u017e\u00edv\u00e1ny, jejich pou\u017eit\u00ed je v\u0161ak omezeno <strong data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"968\">fluorescen\u010dn\u00edm pozad\u00edm<\/strong>, kter\u00e9 sni\u017euje citlivost a zvy\u0161uje mez detekce (LOD).<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1068\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Co p\u0159in\u00e1\u0161\u00ed Time-Gated Ramanova Spektroskopie<\/span><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1381\"><strong data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1103\">Time-Gated Ramanova Spektroskopie<\/strong>\u00a0vyu\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 \u010dasov\u00fd rozd\u00edl mezi okam\u017eit\u00fdm Ramanov\u00fdm rozptylem a pomalej\u0161\u00ed fluorescen\u010dn\u00ed emis\u00ed. D\u00edky p\u0159esn\u00e9 synchronizaci laserov\u00fdch pulz\u016f s detektorem dok\u00e1\u017ee TGRS <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1292\">potla\u010dit fluorescen\u010dn\u00ed \u0161um<\/strong> a selektivn\u011b zachytit \u010dist\u00fd Raman\u016fv sign\u00e1l \u2013 i v opticky n\u00e1ro\u010dn\u00fdch kultiva\u010dn\u00edch m\u00e9di\u00edch.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1574\">Ve studii byl pou\u017eit p\u0159\u00edstup <strong data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1444\">modelov\u00e1n\u00ed \u010dist\u00fdch komponent<\/strong> a anal\u00fdza <strong data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1483\">Net Analyte Signal (NAS)<\/strong> pro porovn\u00e1n\u00ed TGRS s konven\u010dn\u00ed Ramanovou spektroskopi\u00ed na vzorc\u00edch z CHO bun\u011b\u010dn\u00fdch kultur.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1603\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Kl\u00ed\u010dov\u00e9 v\u00fdsledky studie<\/span><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1763\"><strong data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1640\">Vy\u0161\u0161\u00ed pom\u011br sign\u00e1l\/\u0161um (SNR):<\/strong> TGRS dos\u00e1hla konzistentn\u011b vy\u0161\u0161\u00edho SNR u v\u0161ech p\u011bti sledovan\u00fdch analyt\u016f, co\u017e vedlo k jasn\u011bj\u0161\u00edm a spolehliv\u011bj\u0161\u00edm spektr\u016fm.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1940\"><strong data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1795\">Ni\u017e\u0161\u00ed meze detekce (LOD):<\/strong> U n\u011bkter\u00fdch analyt\u016f do\u0161lo ke sn\u00ed\u017een\u00ed LOD a\u017e o n\u011bkolik \u0159\u00e1d\u016f, co\u017e umo\u017e\u0148uje <strong data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1908\">d\u0159\u00edv\u011bj\u0161\u00ed detekci metabolick\u00fdch zm\u011bn<\/strong> a rychlej\u0161\u00ed z\u00e1sah do procesu.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"2110\"><strong data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1974\">Lep\u0161\u00ed chemick\u00e1 selektivita:<\/strong> NAS anal\u00fdza potvrdila ost\u0159ej\u0161\u00ed a l\u00e9pe rozli\u0161en\u00e9 Ramanovy p\u00edky, co\u017e indikuje sn\u00ed\u017een\u00e9 spektr\u00e1ln\u00ed interference a vy\u0161\u0161\u00ed specificitu m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2162\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Pr\u016flom pro PAT (Process Analytical Technology)<\/span><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2464\">V\u00fdsledky jasn\u011b ukazuj\u00ed, \u017ee TGRS m\u00e1 potenci\u00e1l <strong data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2243\">v\u00fdznamn\u011b pos\u00edlit PAT strategie<\/strong> v upstream bioprocesingu. Umo\u017e\u0148uje citliv\u011bj\u0161\u00ed, p\u0159esn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed a skute\u010dn\u011b inline m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed kl\u00ed\u010dov\u00fdch procesn\u00edch prom\u011bnn\u00fdch, co\u017e je z\u00e1sadn\u00ed pro pokro\u010dil\u00e9 \u0159\u00edzen\u00ed proces\u016f, optimalizaci v\u00fdroby a dal\u0161\u00ed rozvoj automatizace v biov\u00fdrob\u011b.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2488\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">V\u00fdhled do budoucna<\/span><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2751\">Auto\u0159i studie pl\u00e1nuj\u00ed dal\u0161\u00ed v\u00fdzkum zam\u011b\u0159en\u00fd na v\u00fdvoj <strong data-start=\"2543\" data-end=\"2569\">chemometrick\u00fdch model\u016f<\/strong>, kter\u00e9 umo\u017en\u00ed p\u0159ev\u00e9st TGRS sign\u00e1ly do kvantitativn\u00edch procesn\u00edch informac\u00ed v dynamick\u00e9m prost\u0159ed\u00ed bioreaktor\u016f. T\u00edm se otev\u00edr\u00e1 cesta k \u0161ir\u0161\u00edmu pr\u016fmyslov\u00e9mu nasazen\u00ed t\u00e9to technologie. Detaily studie si m\u016f\u017eete <a href=\"https:\/\/link.springer.com\/article\/10.1007\/s00449-025-03261-y?utm_source=chatgpt.com\"><strong>pro\u010d\u00edst zde<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Nov\u00e1 studie publikovan\u00e1 v odborn\u00e9m \u010dasopise Bioprocess and Biosystems Engineering ukazuje, \u017ee Time-Gated Ramanova Spektroskopie (TGRS) v\u00fdrazn\u011b zvy\u0161uje citlivost p\u0159i monitorov\u00e1n\u00ed komplexn\u00edch upstream bioproces\u016f. Tento pokrok m\u00e1 z\u00e1sadn\u00ed v\u00fdznam pro real-time \u0159\u00edzen\u00ed proces\u016f v biofarmaceutick\u00e9 v\u00fdrob\u011b. Bioprocesy, zejm\u00e9na kultivace sav\u010d\u00edch bun\u011bk, jako jsou nap\u0159. CHO (Chinese Hamster Ovary), vy\u017eaduj\u00ed p\u0159esn\u00e9 a kontinu\u00e1ln\u00ed sledov\u00e1n\u00ed kl\u00ed\u010dov\u00fdch analyt\u016f [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":13000,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[139,9],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-12999","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-139","category-novinky"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v26.8 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Vy\u0161\u0161\u00ed citlivost anal\u00fdzy v upstream bioprocesu d\u00edky Time-Gated Raman spektroskopii - Nicolet CZ<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/vyssi-citlivost-analytiky-v-upstream-bioprocesu-diky-time-gated-raman-spektroskopii\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" co